column31:
*Acceptance Criteria:* 

* For All view permission only list page will be displayed and user cannot do any operation in contact management and role management from browse page : 
 it includes ,
if the user has view permission in contact managment: 
operations like Authorize,Resend,Deactivate will not be available in contact management browse page 
if the user has Edit permission in contact management ; 
Operations like Edit, Resend,Deactivate will be accessible. create and delete button will be disabled 
* if the user has Delete  permission in contact management ; 
Operations like delete will be enabled and they cannot access create,edit etc.

