22/Jul/25 12:00 PM;61e900cef0ed0400689392d4;[~accountid:6090062d2c2f6c0068c1341b] ,
We are getting updateAt value for non modified data even {{modifiedBy}} is getting as null, Please update {{updatedAt}} value as null for non modified data

Current Response Data >

!image-20250722-062939.png|width=671,height=394,alt="image-20250722-062939.png"!



*Current FE Code For Updated By>*

{noformat}          {
            accessorKey: 'modifiedBy',
            size: 160,
            header: () => (
              <HeaderWithSort
                headerLabel="Updated By"
                sortKey="modifiedBy.fullName"
                wrapperCls=" font-medium text-secondary-foreground align-left"
                contextHook={() => asSortContext(useSOWListContext())}
              />
            ),
            cell: (info) => {
              const value = info.getValue();
              const data = value?.fullName;
              return (
                <TextRender
                  needTitle
                  wrapperClass="text-sm font-medium"
                  text={data || 'NA'}
                />
              );
            },
          },{noformat}

column31:
# *Create Page* : 
 → Update “Portfolio” to “RFP Type”

# *RFP list page* : 
 → Redirection to RFP Template page on direct click on Records
 → 3 Dots:  
               => Replace “View” by “View Detail Page”
               => Add one more option “View RFP Template” (Redirect to RFP Template page)

# *RFP Detail page with Draft status* : Remove “View RFP Template” button
# *RFP Template :*  Add the default text given below: 

{color:#4c9aff}_[Client Name] is looking for a [Service Name] company to service its Portfolio.  Here is the key information to provide this bid:_{color}

{color:#4c9aff}  _1.  See the full Scope Of Work (SOW) in an additional attachment within the email._{color}
{color:#4c9aff}  _2. A Vendor Response Sheet is required for submission of the proposal by the deadline._{color}
{color:#4c9aff}  _3. This Client mandates the involvement of a third-party insurance compliance company. To offer services, providers must complete the onboarding process with said third-party insurance company  if awarded the work._{color}
{color:#4c9aff}  _4. The Standard Contract Agreement is included, which outlines their insurance requirements.  Please review these in detail prior to providing a proposal.  The client will not accept any changes to their contract.  Please do not submit a proposal if any changes to the contract would be requested or required._{color} _-_ *(Exclude this point if the RFP Type is Individual)*
  {color:#4c9aff}_5. Please ensure your proposal includes taxes, if applicable.  If taxes are not applicable, then please be clear that they are not applicable to your submission/service._{color}
{color:#4c9aff} _6. The client has the option to choose either a single vendor for all their properties or multiple vendors. Please make sure that the pricing reflects the costs for both single-site and multiple-property scenarios._{color}

{color:#4c9aff}_To be considered for this proposal, please submit your bids promptly, no later than_{color} {color:#ff991f}_[RFP Due Date]_{color}_._ {color:#4c9aff}_Bids can be for the full portfolio, or single communities._{color}

*NB:* {color:#ff991f}*Date*{color} *should be added based on the RFP due date :* Refer Doc : [Acento RFP Common Area Cleaning - DMV|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uWwSqRmVqIk4vieWnuUWuY1IbK0YCGSJ/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=108312163037740152037&rtpof=true&sd=true]

*Module:* Client Create 
*Issue:* Current error message is generic and does not reflect network-related failures accurately.

*Current Behavior:*

* Displays: {{"Error. An error occurred while retrieving selected vendors."}}
* Console shows:

* {{GET ...vendors/preferred?ids=... net::ERR_FAILED 403}}
* {{Uncaught (in promise) Error: Request failed with status code 403}}

*Expected Behavior:*

* Display a more user-friendly and context-aware message when network latency or permission issues occur.

*Suggested Messaging Logic:*

* *If error is network-related (403, ERR_FAILED, timeout):*

{{"Network is slow or temporarily unavailable. Please check your connection and try again."}}

* *Fallback for unexpected errors:*
* {{"Something went wrong while retrieving vendors. Please refresh or contact support."}}

*Acceptance Criteria:*

* Error messages update dynamically based on error type.
* Messages are clear, empathetic, and actionable.
* Console errors are logged but not exposed to end users.

*Priority:* Medium
*Tags:* {{UI/UX}}, {{Error Messaging}}, {{Client Create}}, {{Network Handling}}

