column629:
03/Feb/26 2:16 PM;6090062d2c2f6c0068c1341b;*Issue:* When filtering the RFP table by "RFP Sent Date", selecting the same date for both start and end resulted in no data being displayed. This occurred because the end date filter defaulted to midnight (00:00:00) of the selected date, excluding any RFPs sent later in the day.

*Fix:* Updated the

findAllmethod in

{noformat}RfPService{noformat}

(*apps/sow-rfq/src/services/rfp/rfp.service.ts*) to correctly handle date boundaries using

{noformat}date-fns{noformat}

:



* {noformat}sendDateFrom{noformat}
: Now explicitly uses 
{noformat}startOfDay{noformat}
to ensure the filter starts from 00:00:00.
* {noformat}sendDateTo{noformat}
: Now explicitly uses 
{noformat}endOfDay{noformat}
to ensure the filter includes the entire day up to 23:59:59.

[~accountid:63c8e40fd579d7c687552750] [~accountid:712020:23854557-7994-458c-9069-76dafb07b292] 

*Result:* Filtering by a date range, including single-day ranges, now correctly retrieves all RFPs sent within that full timeframe.

