Trello ticket link: [https://trello.com/c/whSP2O4z|https://trello.com/c/whSP2O4z]

The goal of the vendor display ID is to create a more easily-human-shareable indicator for a vendor. This will reduce ambiguity in which vendor is being discussed (sometimes a vendor is added twice with different names).

I’d like the vendor display ID to start with “CX-” and contain 6 characters after that. The technique I used was a version of a “Crockford” that additionally drops the zero along with the characters “I, L, O, and U”.

{code:js}const ALPHABET = '123456789ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRSTVWXYZ' // Crockford, excludes I L O U 0{code}

An example output would be:

{noformat}CX-7K2NQ9{noformat}
